{"4795240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scare: Fatal Picture - Remake", "steam_appid": 4795240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scare: Fatal Picture - Remake is a third-person horror game in which you'll face a ghost tribe called Era, using a camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tYour sister has been taken by the ghost tribe Era — destined to be devoured by their Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tYou play as Madoka, a young woman armed with a special camera built by her parents to combat ghosts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795240/extras/8cc67bcc9fab82392235dbc132661045.poster.avif?t=1787775287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795240/extras/8cc67bcc9fab82392235dbc132661045.webm?t=1787775287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795240/extras/8cc67bcc9fab82392235dbc132661045.mp4?t=1787775287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tUsing your camera, you'll face enemies by taking pictures, collecting points, upgrading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795240/extras/084c1682e98074b95334dbd60479fcfe.poster.avif?t=1787775287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795240/extras/084c1682e98074b95334dbd60479fcfe.webm?t=1787775287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795240/extras/084c1682e98074b95334dbd60479fcfe.mp4?t=